cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MFIOP Toolkit — Mesoscopic Field-Infrared Oscillatory Processing"
abstract: >
  Minimal reproducible implementation of the MFIOP geometry → spectrum pipeline.
  Maps protein structures (PDB) to dipolar coupling matrices and computes the
  anisotropic infrared spectral response A(ω) directly from atomic coordinates,
  with no fitted parameters.
